<p><strong>References</strong></p>
  <p>Amano, Robert,  Stefano Gnocchi, Sylvain Leduc, Joel Wagner. 2020. &ldquo;<a href="https://www.frbsf.org/economic-research/publications/working-papers/2020/21/">Average Is Good Enough:  Average-Inflation Targeting and the ELB</a>.&rdquo; Federal Reserve Bank of San Francisco  Working Paper (June). </p><p>
