  Williams, John C. 2018. &ldquo;<a href="https://www.frbsf.org/economic-research/publications/economic-letter/2018/may/are-future-fortunes-of-r-star-really-rising/">The Future Fortunes of R-star: Are They Really Rising?</a>&rdquo; Federal Reserve Bank of San Francisco Economic Letter,  2018-13 (May 21).</p>
